      effects: {mem}, capabilities: {},
      justification: "libpdx-argv.M4-001 + ENH-009 case21 — mantissa 2^34 with the 'g' (shl 30) suffix: shr r9,34 on 2^34 yields 1 (nonzero), so ps_shl_30's pre-shift gate must reject this before shl rcx,30 ever executes and silently wraps.",
      block: {
